          "$comment": "Routing prefers the official Moonshot AI deployment, falls back to the pool. repetition_penalty was removed 2026-08-23 during the reasoning-cliff investigation: a short-prompt A/B suggested suppression (19/39/29 with vs 37/173/93 without) but long-context probes did not reproduce it, and the cliff's degradation predated the penalty's addition, so it was not the cause. The 2026-08-19 '!' degenerate streams it was added for are contained by the degenerate-stream-guard extension instead. NOTE: $comment is only safe at THIS level - samplingParams and openRouterRouting are forwarded verbatim to the API, a $comment inside them 400s the request.",
          "compat": {
            "openRouterRouting": {
              "order": [
                "Moonshot AI"
              ],
              "allow_fallbacks": true
            }
          }
        },
